{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-unital","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:unital","kind":"definition","title":"Unital subset","uses":["papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-groebner-basis","papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-leading-term-data"],"cites":["references/leitnerpawloski2004"],"tags":["groebner-basis","unital"],"leanRef":"ugb:UGB.UnitalGroebner.UnitalGroebnerBasis","text":"unital.md","leanSource":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/unital.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:unital\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(B, &#x3C;)</code> be as in the\n<a href=\"#def:groebner-basis\">Gröbner--Shirshov basis</a> definition, and let\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G = \\{g_\\gamma \\mid \\gamma \\in \\Gamma\\}</code> be a subset of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</p>\n<p>A subset <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G \\subseteq A</code> is <strong>unital</strong> if:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>For all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma \\in \\Gamma</code>:\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{LC}(g_\\gamma) \\in R^\\times</code> (the units of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>).</li>\n<li>For all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma \\in \\Gamma</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha, \\beta \\in B</code>:\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{LC}(\\alpha \\cdot g_\\gamma \\cdot \\beta) \\in R^\\times</code>\nwhenever <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha \\cdot g_\\gamma \\cdot \\beta \\neq 0</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If the ground ring is a field, every Gröbner--Shirshov basis is automatically\nunital. If <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">B</code> is closed under multiplication, condition (b) follows\nfrom (a).</p>\n","source":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/unital.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Definition","number":"2.3.3"}
